    <string name="privacy_policy_txt">At Bookmark, your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you use our app. \n\n1. Information We Collect \n• Personal Information: Such as your name, email address, and contact details when you sign up or get in touch with us. \n• Usage Data: Like which features you use, device type, and app performance statistics. \n• Location Data: Only if you allow us, for features that may require it. \n\n2. How We Use Your Information We use the data to: \n• Provide and improve our services. \n• Personalise your experience. \n• Send relevant updates or promotions (only with your permission). \n• Respond to support requests and feedback. \n\n3. How We Protect Your Data \nWe follow industry-standard security measures to keep your information safe. Your data is stored securely and only accessed by authorised personnel. \n\n4. Sharing Your Information We do not sell your personal data. We may share your information with trusted third-party service providers who help us operate the app—always under strict confidentiality agreements. \n\n5. Your Rights • You can request to view, update, or delete your personal data at any time. • You can opt out of marketing communications via your settings or by contacting us. \n\n6. Children’s Privacy Our app is intended for use by adults and school administrators. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. \n\n7. Changes to This Policy We may update this Privacy Policy occasionally. If we make significant changes, we’ll let you know via the app or email. \n\n8. Contact Us If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please email us at: info@bookmark.com.pk</string>
